#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:4
msgid ""
"This filter adds a color array to map label values to specific colors. The "
"mapping can be specified explicitly with a dictionary or implicitly with a "
"colormap or sequence of colors. The implicit mapping is controlled with two "
"coloring modes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:9
msgid ""
"``'index'`` : The input scalar values (label ids) are used as index values "
"for indexing the specified ``colors``. This creates a direct relationship "
"between labels and colors such that a given label will always have the same "
"color, regardless of the number of labels present in the dataset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:14
msgid ""
"This option is used by default for unsigned 8-bit integer inputs, i.e. "
"scalars with whole numbers and a maximum range of ``[0, 255]``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:17
msgid ""
"``'cycle'`` : The specified ``colors`` are cycled through sequentially, and "
"each unique value in the input scalars is assigned a color in increasing "
"order. Unlike with ``'index'`` mode, the colors are not directly mapped to "
"the labels, but instead depends on the number of labels at the input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:22
msgid ""
"This option is used by default for floating-point inputs or for inputs with "
"values out of the range ``[0, 255]``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.data_set.DataSetFilters.color_labels:25
msgid ""
"By default, a new ``'int_rgb'`` array is added with the same name as the "
"specified ``scalars`` but with ``_rgb`` appended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/data_set.pydocstring
