"scalars are specified, the input image is first re-meshed with "
":meth:`~pyvista.ImageDataFilters.cells_to_points` to transform the cell data"
" into point data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
