#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.contour_labels:147
msgid ""
"Simplify the ``'boundary_labels'`` array as a single-component 1D array. If "
"``False``, the returned ``'boundary_labels'`` array is a two-component 2D "
"array. This simplification is useful when only external boundaries are "
"generated and/or when visualizing internal boundaries. The simplification is"
" as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.contour_labels:153
msgid ""
"External boundaries are simplified by keeping the first component and "
"removing the second. Since external polygons may only share a boundary with "
"the background, the second component is always ``background_value`` and "
"therefore can be dropped without loss of information. The values of external"
" boundaries always match the foreground values of the input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.contour_labels:159
msgid ""
"Internal boundaries are simplified by assigning them unique negative values "
"sequentially. E.g. the boundary label ``[1, 2]`` is replaced with ``-1``, "
"``[1, 3]`` is replaced with ``-2``, etc. The mapping to negative values is "
"not fixed, and can change depending on the input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.contour_labels:164
msgid ""
"This simplification is particularly useful for unsigned integer labels (e.g."
" scalars with ``'uint8'`` dtype) since external boundaries will be positive "
"and internal boundaries will be negative in this case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.contour_labels:168
