#: of pyvista.core.filters.image_data.ImageDataFilters.label_connectivity:4
msgid ""
"Only points whose `scalar` value is within the `scalar_range` are considered"
" for connectivity. A 4-connectivity is used for 2D images or a "
"6-connectivity for 3D images. This filter operates on point-based data. If "
"cell-based data are provided, they are re-meshed to a point-based "
"representation using :func:`~pyvista.ImageDataFilters.cells_to_points` and "
"the output is meshed back to a cell-based representation with "
":func:`~pyvista.ImageDataFilters.points_to_cells`, effectively filtering "
"based on face connectivity. The connected regions are extracted and labelled"
" according to the strategy defined by ``extraction_mode`` and "
"``label_mode``, respectively. Unconnected regions are labelled with ``0`` "
"value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/filters/image_data.pydocstring
