"forwarded verbatim to the handler as ``**kwargs``. Use them to expose "
"format-specific options such as compression level, thread count, or "
"chunking.  When no custom writer is registered for the target extension, "
"passing extra keyword arguments to :meth:`~pyvista.DataObject.save` raises "
":class:`TypeError`; PyVista never silently drops writer options."
