msgid "**Dispatch order**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../pyvista/doc/source/api/readers/index.rst:165
msgid ""
"When :meth:`~pyvista.DataObject.save` is called, custom writers registered "
"via :func:`pyvista.register_writer` are dispatched *before* built-in VTK "
"writers for the same extension, mirroring the dispatch order used by "
":func:`pyvista.read`.  By default, registering a handler for an extension "
"that collides with a built-in PyVista writer raises :class:`ValueError`; "
"pass ``override=True`` to replace the built-in writer."
msgstr ""

