#: of pyvista.core.utilities.features.perlin_noise:19
msgid ""
"``amplitude`` can be negative. The noise function varies randomly between "
"``-|Amplitude|`` and ``|Amplitude|``. Therefore the range of values is "
"``2*|Amplitude|`` large. The initial amplitude is 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../../opt/hostedtoolcache/Python/3.13.14/x64/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pyvista/core/utilities/features.pydocstring
